<title>USA: Ferro Corp President Ortino named COO.</title>
<headline>Ferro Corp President Ortino named COO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferro Corp said Friday that company President Hector Ortino has been named to the additional post of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Werner Bush, the executive vice president and chief operating officer who has elected to take early retirement, the company said.</p>
<p>Ferro Corp said Bush will no longer be actively employed by the company as of December 31. Effective immediately, he also will no longer serve on the company's board of directors, it said.</p>
<p>Ortino became president in February.</p>
